{"seq":2,"slug":"iot-sensor-edge-computing","title":"博士精准农业 — 物联网传感器网络与边缘计算","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/agriculture/precision-agriculture/smart-farming/iot-sensor-edge-computing","wordCount":1772,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"博士精准农业-物联网传感器网络与边缘计算\">博士精准农业 — 物联网传感器网络与边缘计算</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>精准农业的实时决策依赖于田间传感器网络持续采集的土壤、气象和作物数据。物联网（IoT）架构将分散的传感器节点通过低功耗广域网（LPWAN）连接到数据平台，而边缘计算在靠近数据源的位置执行预处理和初步决策，减少对云端的延迟和带宽依赖。构建可靠、低成本、可扩展的农业 IoT 系统是智慧农场的基础设施挑战。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"农业传感器类型\">农业传感器类型</h3><p>田间传感器按监测对象分为三大类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>传感器</th>\n<th>测量参数</th>\n<th>典型精度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>土壤</td>\n<td>TDR/FDR 探头</td>\n<td>体积含水量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>±2%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>土壤</td>\n<td>EC 传感器</td>\n<td>电导率（盐分）</td>\n<td>±5%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>土壤</td>\n<td>张力计 / MPS-6</td>\n<td>水势 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ψ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\psi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ψ</span></span></span></span></span> (kPa)</td>\n<td>±10%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>气象</td>\n<td>温湿度探头</td>\n<td>温度/RH</td>\n<td>±0.3°C / ±2%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>气象</td>\n<td>翻斗式雨量计</td>\n<td>降水量</td>\n<td>±5%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>气象</td>\n<td>净辐射计</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> (W/m²)</td>\n<td>±5%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>作物</td>\n<td>叶面温度计（IRT）</td>\n<td>冠层温度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>±0.5°C</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>作物</td>\n<td>茎流传感器</td>\n<td>单株蒸腾量</td>\n<td>±10-15%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>作物</td>\n<td>光谱反射探头</td>\n<td>NDVI / PRI</td>\n<td>±0.02</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>土壤水分传感器部署策略</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[传感器布局设计] --&gt; B[空间布局]&#10;    A --&gt; C[深度分层]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;代表性管理区各放置 1 站&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[&quot;ECa 引导分层抽样&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;10 cm: 表层蒸发响应&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[&quot;30 cm: 根区主体&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[&quot;60 cm: 深层排水/毛管上升&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[传感器布局设计] --&gt; B[空间布局]\n    A --&gt; C[深度分层]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"代表性管理区各放置 1 站\"]\n    B --&gt; B2[\"ECa 引导分层抽样\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"10 cm: 表层蒸发响应\"]\n    C --&gt; C2[\"30 cm: 根区主体\"]\n    C --&gt; C3[\"60 cm: 深层排水/毛管上升\"]</pre><p>通常在每个管理区放置 1-2 个多深度土壤水分站，总安装密度约 1 站/5-20 ha。</p>\n<h3 id=\"低功耗广域网通信\">低功耗广域网通信</h3><p>农业 IoT 的通信需求特点：远距离（1-15 km）、低数据速率（每小时几十字节）、超低功耗（电池寿命 2-5 年）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>协议</th>\n<th>频段</th>\n<th>覆盖距离</th>\n<th>带宽</th>\n<th>功耗</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>LoRaWAN</td>\n<td>Sub-GHz (免授权)</td>\n<td>2-15 km</td>\n<td>0.3-50 kbps</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NB-IoT</td>\n<td>授权频段 (运营商)</td>\n<td>1-10 km</td>\n<td>200 kbps</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中（需 SIM 卡）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sigfox</td>\n<td>Sub-GHz (免授权)</td>\n<td>3-50 km</td>\n<td>100 bps</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4G LTE-M</td>\n<td>授权频段</td>\n<td>1-10 km</td>\n<td>1 Mbps</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>LoRaWAN</strong> 在农业中最流行，因为：（1）Sub-GHz 频段在田间障碍物少的条件下穿透力强；（2）免授权频段无月租；（3）支持 Class A 极低功耗模式（仅在上行后短暂开放下行窗口）。</p>\n<p>LoRa 链路预算估算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>32.44</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>10</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>10</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{path} = 32.44 + 20\\log_{10}(f_{MHz}) + 20\\log_{10}(d_{km})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32.44</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>加上接收灵敏度（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>137</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-137</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">137</span></span></span></span></span> dBm @ SF12）和天线增益，可计算最大通信距离。在平坦农田中，5 dBi 天线高度 2 m 时通常可覆盖 5-8 km。</p>\n<p><strong>LoRaWAN 网络架构</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[传感器节点] --&gt; |LoRa| B[网关 Gateway]&#10;    B --&gt; |IP 网络| C[网络服务器 LNS]&#10;    C --&gt; D[应用服务器]&#10;    D --&gt; E[仪表盘 / 报警]\">graph LR\n    A[传感器节点] --&gt; |LoRa| B[网关 Gateway]\n    B --&gt; |IP 网络| C[网络服务器 LNS]\n    C --&gt; D[应用服务器]\n    D --&gt; E[仪表盘 / 报警]</pre><p>单个网关可同时服务数百到数千个节点（得益于 LoRa 的 chirp 扩频和多 SF 正交性）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"传感器节点设计\">传感器节点设计</h3><p>低功耗节点的硬件架构：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>典型选型</th>\n<th>功耗</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MCU</td>\n<td>STM32L4 / nRF52840</td>\n<td>1-5 mA (active), 1-10 μA (sleep)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LoRa 收发器</td>\n<td>SX1276 / SX1262</td>\n<td>120 mA (Tx), 10 mA (Rx)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传感器接口</td>\n<td>SDI-12 / Modbus RTU / Analog</td>\n<td>取决于传感器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电源</td>\n<td>太阳能 + LiFePO₄ 电池</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>功耗预算计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{avg} = \\frac{P_{sleep} \\cdot T_{sleep} + P_{active} \\cdot T_{active} + P_{tx} \\cdot T_{tx}}{T_{cycle}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">cy</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ee</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ee</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对于每 15 分钟采样一次、LoRa SF7 传输的典型配置：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>时长</th>\n<th>电流</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>深度睡眠</td>\n<td>~899 s</td>\n<td>5 μA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传感器读取</td>\n<td>~1 s</td>\n<td>15 mA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LoRa 发送</td>\n<td>~0.1 s</td>\n<td>120 mA</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>899</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>120</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><mn>900</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>5.03</mn><mtext> μA</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{avg} = \\frac{5 \\times 899 + 15 \\times 1 + 120 \\times 0.1}{900} \\approx 5.03 \\text{ μA}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">900</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">899</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">120</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5.03</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> μA</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>3000 mAh LiFePO₄ 电池理论寿命 &gt; 5 年（不考虑自放电和温度影响）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"边缘计算架构\">边缘计算架构</h3><p>边缘计算将部分计算从云端下沉到田间网关或本地服务器：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>设备</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>设备层</td>\n<td>传感器节点 MCU</td>\n<td>数据采集、基础滤波</td>\n<td>~ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>雾/边缘层</td>\n<td>网关（RPi/Jetson）</td>\n<td>数据聚合、异常检测、本地 ML 推理</td>\n<td>~100ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>云层</td>\n<td>AWS/Azure</td>\n<td>长期存储、模型训练、全局优化</td>\n<td>~s</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>边缘适合处理的任务</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>异常值过滤</strong>：传感器故障或极端值检测（如突然跳变 &gt; 3σ）</li>\n<li><strong>数据聚合</strong>：将 15 分钟间隔数据聚合为小时均值再上传，减少 70% 以上通信量</li>\n<li><strong>阈值报警</strong>：土壤水分低于灌溉触发线时立即发送本地指令</li>\n<li><strong>轻量级 ML</strong>：在 TensorFlow Lite / ONNX Runtime 上运行作物胁迫分类模型</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>边缘不适合处理的任务</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>复杂的多田块联合优化</li>\n<li>大规模模型训练</li>\n<li>长时间序列趋势分析</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"数据管理与时间序列数据库\">数据管理与时间序列数据库</h3><p>农业传感器每小时产生 4-96 个数据点/节点，100 个节点的网络每年产生 ~100 GB 时间序列数据。时间序列数据库（TSDB）是专门优化的存储方案：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>TSDB</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>适用规模</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>InfluxDB</td>\n<td>SQL-like 查询、内置降采样</td>\n<td>中小型部署</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TimescaleDB</td>\n<td>PostgreSQL 扩展、SQL 全兼容</td>\n<td>需要关系型查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>QuestDB</td>\n<td>极高写入速度</td>\n<td>高频数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>典型数据管理策略：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>原始数据保留 30 天</li>\n<li>小时聚合数据保留 1 年</li>\n<li>日聚合数据永久保留</li>\n<li>连续聚合（Continuous Aggregate）自动执行降采样</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"安全与可靠性\">安全与可靠性</h3><p>田间 IoT 系统面临独特的安全和可靠性挑战：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>挑战</th>\n<th>缓解策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>节点物理暴露</td>\n<td>IP67 防护等级、防篡改设计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通信窃听</td>\n<td>LoRaWAN AES-128 加密（AppSKey + NwkSKey）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传感器漂移</td>\n<td>定期校准、交叉验证冗余传感器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网关断网</td>\n<td>本地缓存 + 断网续传</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电源故障</td>\n<td>太阳能 + 电池冗余、低电量预警</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>设计一个覆盖 200 公顷灌溉玉米田的 IoT 监测网络。明确：传感器类型和数量、通信协议选择、网关位置和数量、数据采样频率和边缘/云分工。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某 LoRaWAN 节点使用 SF12（接收灵敏度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>137</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-137</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">137</span></span></span></span></span> dBm），发射功率 14 dBm，天线增益 2 dBi。在自由空间路径损耗模型下，868 MHz 的最大通信距离是多少？实际农田中为什么通常比理论值短 30-50%？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>边缘计算在农业 IoT 中的核心价值之一是降低通信量。如果原始数据每 5 分钟采样一次、全量上传到云端，改为边缘聚合后每小时上传一次小时均值和最值，通信量降低百分比是多少？讨论这种聚合可能丢失的信息。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>讨论开源 IoT 平台（如 ChirpStack + Grafana + InfluxDB）与商业平台（如 The Things Network + DataCake）在 100 节点规模农业部署中的优劣。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>Tzounis, A. et al. (2017). &quot;Internet of Things in agriculture, recent advances and future challenges.&quot; <em>Biosystems Engineering</em> — 农业 IoT 综述。</li>\n<li>LoRa Alliance Specification: <a href=\"https://lora-alliance.org\">https://lora-alliance.org</a> — LoRaWAN 协议官方文档。</li>\n<li>ChirpStack: <a href=\"https://www.chirpstack.io\">https://www.chirpstack.io</a> — 开源 LoRaWAN 网络服务器。</li>\n<li>Satyanarayanan, M. (2017). &quot;The emergence of edge computing.&quot; <em>Computer</em> — 边缘计算的概念框架。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>农业 IoT 系统通过传感器网络将田间的物理世界数字化，LoRaWAN 等 LPWAN 协议以极低功耗实现公里级覆盖。边缘计算在网关层执行数据预处理和实时报警，减少对云端的依赖。系统设计的核心权衡在于：传感器密度与成本、采样频率与功耗、边缘智能与系统复杂度。可靠性和长期维护——而非初始部署——才是农业 IoT 在真实生产环境中面临的最大挑战。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"博士精准农业 — 物联网传感器网络与边缘计算","id":"博士精准农业-物联网传感器网络与边缘计算"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"农业传感器类型","id":"农业传感器类型"},{"level":3,"text":"低功耗广域网通信","id":"低功耗广域网通信"},{"level":3,"text":"传感器节点设计","id":"传感器节点设计"},{"level":3,"text":"边缘计算架构","id":"边缘计算架构"},{"level":3,"text":"数据管理与时间序列数据库","id":"数据管理与时间序列数据库"},{"level":3,"text":"安全与可靠性","id":"安全与可靠性"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"博士精准农业 — 变量施用技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/agriculture/precision-agriculture/smart-farming/variable-rate-technology"},"next":{"title":"博士精准农业 — 农业自主机器人","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/agriculture/precision-agriculture/smart-farming/autonomous-agricultural-robots"}}